# Translation of Odoo Server.
# This file contains the translation of the following modules:
# 	* website_pwa_chat
#
# Generated from the module's own .pot so every `#:` reference line survives:
# for a model_terms field those references are how Odoo knows which view a term
# belongs to, and a .po without them imports as nothing at all. Learned the
# hard way on 2026-08-16.
#
# There is no en.po, deliberately. Odoo keeps en_US as the technical base of a
# translatable column and these templates hold their Spanish there with no
# es_ES entry of their own, so an en.po would overwrite the source -- which is
# how 2134 records lost their Spanish on 2026-08-14. An English visitor reads
# the Spanish labels until that base is protected.
#
